## CORE QUIZ ANALYTICS FRAMEWORK

```
The 3 Levels of Quiz Analytics:

Level 1 — Quiz Health (Is this quiz working?)
├── Start rate: quizzes started / widget impressions
├── Completion rate: completions / starts (target: >70%)
├── Email capture rate: emails / completions (target: >30%)
└── Drop-off by question: where do users leave?

Level 2 — Revenue Impact (Is this quiz making money?)
├── Attributed revenue: purchases within 7-day window
├── Conversion rate: purchases / completions (target: >5%)
├── Average order value: revenue / purchase count
└── Revenue per completion: total revenue / completions

Level 3 — Optimization Intelligence (How to improve?)
├── Top result pages by conversion rate
├── Question-level drop-off analysis
├── Answer distribution: which answers selected most?
└── Device split: mobile vs desktop completion rates
```

